   "blocks": [
    {
     "title": "Item Changes",
     "body": "Volskaya Ordnance - Epic Weapon General Item\n\n- Bonus Damage per 100 Bonus Life on target increased to 6% (Up from 5%).\n\nGadget Maximizer - Epic Ability General Item\n\n- Gadget cooldown reduction increased to 35% (Up from 25%).\n\nThree Tap Tommygun - Epic Ability General Item\n\n- Added 0.5s internal cooldown for subsequent applications.\n- Damage reduced to 3% of target's current life (Down from 5%).\n- Damage duration reduced to 3s (Down from 5s).\n\nVortex Vial - Gadget\n\n- Cost reduced to 9000 (Down from 9500).\n- Cooldown reduced to 15s (Down from 25s).",
     "dev": "Three Tap Tommygun has proven to be an outlier in terms of output, so we're reducing the output and making it more difficult to quickly apply multiple stacks of. We're also improving some underused counter options, especially the Anti-Flier gadget."
    }
   ]
